<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK C.BANK RESERVES RISE TO $3.457 BLN - JAN 22.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK C.BANK RESERVES RISE TO $3.457 BLN - JAN 22.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Fridat its hard currency reserves rose to $3.457 billion as of January 22, from $3.254 billion on January 15.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES    Jan 22     Jan 15     Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.457	3.254	3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    2.005	1.936	2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     5.461	5.189	5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
